			  Versions for org.springframework.boot:*, testcontainers (via testcontainers-bom),
			  postgresql, flyway and lombok all come from spring-boot-dependencies, which is the
			  parent of spring-boot-starter-parent. Nothing needs re-declaring here.

			Left them as a note for possible dependencies that might be needed later
                -->
